Download plink.exe/pscp.exe for the matching architecture from the
official release page:
https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/putty/latest.html
Place both files in this directory (deploy\linux-client\). They are not
tracked in this repository - each user/build should fetch and verify
their own copy directly from the official source rather than trust a
third-party redistribution.
